{"id":4831,"date":"2020-10-04T15:35:24","date_gmt":"2020-10-04T14:35:24","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/?p=4831"},"modified":"2020-10-04T15:35:26","modified_gmt":"2020-10-04T14:35:26","slug":"platformio-5-0-1-gestion-des-librairies","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/2020\/10\/04\/platformio-5-0-1-gestion-des-librairies\/","title":{"rendered":"PlatformIO 5.0.1: Gestion des librairies"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Un nouveau mode d&rsquo;utilisation des librairies a \u00e9t\u00e9 mis en place dans la version 5.0.1 de PlatformIO.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Lorsque vous d\u00e9veloppez un projet et que vous avez besoin d&rsquo;une librairie, vous pouvez proc\u00e9der de la mani\u00e8re suivante :<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Allez dans le menu principale et s\u00e9lectionner l&rsquo;onglet verticale Librairies<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"631\" height=\"504\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4832\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L1.png 631w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L1-300x240.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 631px) 100vw, 631px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Puis recherchez votre librairie, par exemple horloge DS3231<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"460\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L2-1024x460.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4833\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L2-1024x460.png 1024w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L2-300x135.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L2-768x345.png 768w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L2.png 1478w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Une fois que vous avez trouv\u00e9 la librairie qui vous int\u00e9resse, cliquez dessus et vous y verrez ces caract\u00e9ristiques :<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">la version actuelle, des exemples &#8230; Si elle vous convient, ne cliquez pas sur le bouton Add to Project, mais cliquez sur l&rsquo;onglet \u00ab\u00a0installation\u00a0\u00bb ainsi vous pourrez s\u00e9lectionner exactement le type d&rsquo;installation que vous d\u00e9sirez faire.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"404\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L3-1024x404.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4834\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L3-1024x404.png 1024w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L3-300x118.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L3-768x303.png 768w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L3.png 1383w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Cliquez sur l&rsquo;onglet \u00ab\u00a0installation\u00a0\u00bb et vous obtiendrez ces informations :<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"929\" height=\"656\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L4.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4835\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L4.png 929w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L4-300x212.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L4-768x542.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 929px) 100vw, 929px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">On vous propose 3 modes d&rsquo;installation de la librairie :<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>&lt;nom de librairie> @ <strong>^<\/strong>X.Y.Z : l&rsquo;accent circonflexe indique qu&rsquo;\u00e0 chaque compilation, PlatformIO mettra \u00e0 jour la librairie si une nouvelle version est disponible.<\/li><li>&lt;nom de librairie> @ <strong>~<\/strong>X.Y.Z : le \u00ab\u00a0tilse\u00a0\u00bb indique qu&rsquo;\u00e0 chaque compilation, PlatformIO mettra \u00e0 jour la librairie pour autant que les version majeur et mineur sont identiques, seul un correctif est disponible. Exemple version ~1.2.5 il faut qu&rsquo;uniquement 5 soit sup\u00e9rieur pour que la mise \u00e0 jour soit faite, mais le 1.2 doit rester.<\/li><li>&lt;nom de librairie> @ X.Y.Z : La version indiqu\u00e9e est forc\u00e9e, il n&rsquo;y aura pas de mise \u00e0 jour.<\/li><\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Allez ensuite dans le fichier platformio.ini et coller ce lien apr\u00e8s la balise Lib_deps comme l&rsquo;exemple ci-dessous :<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"920\" height=\"332\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L5.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4836\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L5.png 920w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L5-300x108.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/PFIO_L5-768x277.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 920px) 100vw, 920px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Lors de la premi\u00e8re compilation, les libraires seront t\u00e9l\u00e9charg\u00e9es dans votre projet.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Je pr\u00e9f\u00e8re ce mode d&rsquo;utilisation \u00e0 d&rsquo;autres qui installent la librairie sur votre PC dans une r\u00e9pertoire commun \u00e0 tous vos projets. Lorsque vous distribuez votre projet \u00e0 un autre d\u00e9veloppeur, les librairies se t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeront si n\u00e9cessaires et tout est propre.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Un nouveau mode d&rsquo;utilisation des librairies a \u00e9t\u00e9 mis en place dans la version 5.0.1 de PlatformIO. Lorsque vous d\u00e9veloppez<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":4,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[282],"tags":[170,471,487,486],"class_list":["post-4831","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-ateliers","tag-arduino","tag-esp32","tag-esp8266","tag-platformio"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4831","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/4"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4831"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4831\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":4837,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4831\/revisions\/4837"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4831"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4831"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4831"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}